									"fragmentFields": [
										{
											"id": "element-html",
											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tKey features at a glance\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The platform provides role-based dashboards and functionalities tailored to all key user groups.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Technicians and service</strong>&nbsp;staff benefit from a ticketing system for fast communication, access to technical documentation, machine records, service history, diagnostic tools, and predictive maintenance, as well as remote support, spare parts catalogs with ordering, offline access to critical documents, mobile apps for on-site work, and appointment scheduling.</li><li><strong>Buyers and operations managers</strong>&nbsp;gain transparency on prices, availability, order history, BOM integration, warranties, contracts, proactive notifications, role-based permissions, ERP API integration, and cost analytics.</li><li><strong>Customer service and management&nbsp;</strong>use ticket and claims handling, feedback systems, training content, AI-assisted first-level support, multilingual capabilities, audit trails, KPI dashboards, performance metrics, SLA overviews, and a scalable, secure system architecture.</li></ul><p><br></p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tCross-Cutting Capabilities, Design &amp; Business Benefits\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The platform combines powerful cross-cutting capabilities with a modern, user-centric design to support efficient and secure operations.</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It offers comprehensive user and company management with authentication, 24/7 self-service access, and a centralized notification center for push, email, and SMS alerts.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">GDPR-compliant data processing ensures the highest security standards, while a fully responsive design enables seamless use across all devices.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The interface features a clean, modern UI with blue accents, intuitive data visualizations, interactive charts, and a modular structure optimized for desktop and mobile. For your company, this results in higher customer satisfaction through fast and transparent service, increased efficiency via role-based workflows, and a secure, scalable platform that grows with your business needs.</span></p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
													}
												}
											}
										}
									],
									"indexed": true
